# L18 set classes, sieves, and generators. Directive list: AGENTS.md, section "Layer checks".

name: set class 3-11 is the major triad
args: describe setclass 3-11
exit: 0
stdout-contains: forte=3-11
stdout-contains: pcs=0,3,7
stdout-contains: icv=0,0,1,1,1,0

---
name: sieve and generator samples match
args: conformance run --subset sieve,generators
exit: 0
stdout-contains: subset=sieve,generators
stdout-contains: pass=14
stdout-contains: fail=0
